    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A modern semi detached three bedroom family home comes to the market in excellent decorative condition throughout. Number 44 is nicely positioned overlooking an open green space within a cul de sac area. Carrig Mill is an exclusive development of only 50 houses in total located approx. 2km from Greystones town centre, beach and dart station. Built circa 2015 this property features an attractive part brick front elevation and super bright well laid out interior.\n\nThis B rated home comes to the market with off street parking, fitted alarm system and modern fully equipped kitchen and bathrooms. The rear garden is mainly laid out in lawn featuring a variety of mature trees, shrubs and plants.\nThe location of this development could arguably be one of the most well situated locations close to an array of local amenities and public transport.\n\nGreystones in general is a great place to live - only minutes drive from the M50, which connects to the main road network of Ireland. The DART railway service brings commuters from Greystones village straight into Dublin City.\n\nPrimary and Secondary schools are within walking distance. As are local supermarkets such as Tesco and Lidl. Carrig Mill is situated within a stone's throw from Adli and the new 'Base' pizzeria. Just a 4-minute walk is Greystones Tennis club, Greystones GAA and Greystones Rugby club and a little further on is Shoreline Leasure Centre where you will find a café, a gym and a swimming pool. \n\nSPECIAL FEATURES\nModern B rated house built in circa 2015.\nQuiet cul de sac area\nHouse overlooks an open green area\nOff street parking\nWell stocked rear garden with mature specimen trees\nHighly effective Stiebel Eltron air to water heat pump system.\nDouble glazing throughout.\nFitted alarm system\nHigh quality ceramic and timber flooring throughout entire downstairs area\nModern shaker style fitted kitchen with Silestone Quartz counter tops.\nState of the art fitted and integrated appliances.\nTop specification bathrooms.\nDirect access from dining area to rear garden \nGated side entrance\nExcellent location within walking distance to town centre.\nExtremely well-maintained development with open green spaces.\n\nAccommodation\n\nEntrance Hall\nAttractive ceramic tiled flooring. Understairs storage\n\nDownstairs WC\nAttractive ceramic tiled flooring and walls. Wc and whb.\n\nLivingroom\nAttractive high quality timber flooring. Large picture window. Views of green open space. Well proportioned room positioned at the front of the property. Wall mounted Dimplex fire\n\nKitchen/dining area\nAttractive ceramic tiled flooring. High and low level fitted units featuring integrated and fitted appliances. Polished stone worktops and breakfast bar. Dining space leads out to garden via french doors. \n\nUtility Room\nTiled floor. Plumbed for washing machine.\n\nFIRST FLOOR:\n\nLanding\nBright and spacious. Access to attic.\n \nBathroom\nFully tiled walls and floor. Bath with glass screen and shower connection. Wc and whb.\n\nMaster Bedroom\nModern range of fitted wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite\nStep in shower unit. Wc and Whb. Fully tiled floor and walls. \n\nBedroom 2\nModern range of fitted wardrobes\n\nBedroom 3 \nModern range of fitted wardrobes\n\nOUTSIDE\n\nTo the front\nCobblelock driveway provides off street parking for 2 cars side by side. Boundary hedging. Gated side entrance.\n\nTo the rear:\nMainly laid out in lawn featuring a large patio area. Mature well stocked rear garden with specimen trees, plants and shrubs. Timber and concrete post boundary fencing. Timber garden shed.\n"
      },
